      "original_record": "history",
      "value": "Using the values in the table, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=2) & =P((X,Y)\\in \\{(2,2),(2,3)\\}) \\\\  & =P((X,Y)=(2,2))+P((X,Y)=(2,3)) \\\\  & =f(2,2)+f(2,3) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
